{"id":"wb-6-795","name":"玉泉观","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"玉泉观","text":"玉泉观位于中国甘肃省天水市秦州区，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位，2010年被列为国家4A级旅游景区。\n玉泉观始建于唐代，现存为明、清建筑，共有90余座建筑，玉皇殿为保存最完整的明代建筑之一。玉泉观内珍存历代碑石55方,石碣11方。其中元代碑石5方,石碣11方,明代碑石9方，尤以元代镌刻的四面道流碑最为珍贵。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%8E%89%E6%B3%89%E8%A7%82","revisionId":86545179,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86545179","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1b48deccbd69f6e663f81415.jpg","title":"Tianshui_Yuquan_Guan_2014.01.03_16-39-45.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tianshui_Yuquan_Guan_2014.01.03_16-39-45.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d5/Tianshui_Yuquan_Guan_2014.01.03_16-39-45.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"天水玉泉观","width":320,"height":213}}